2025-09-30 21:00:00,284 [WARNING] Skipped idx=165: gold or llm supporting sentence is empty. gold='', llm='The pro-apoptotic TAp73 isoforms, specifically TAp73α and TAp73β, have been identified in humans. These isoforms are regulated by the extrinsic P1 promoter, and their expression can be reduced due to hypermethylation of this promoter, which is a form of epigenetic regulation. The intrinsic P2 promoter, on the other hand, controls the expression of the anti-apoptotic ΔNp73 isoforms, and its hypomethylation is associated with the over-expression of these isoforms, particularly in non-small cell lung carcinomas (NSCLCs). This over-expression of ΔNp73 mRNA, especially in squamous cell carcinomas, has been linked to global DNA hypomethylation, as indicated by a strong correlation with LINE-1 element hypomethylation.'
